    {
      "start_ms": 58800,
      "end_ms": 62640,
      "start": "00:00:58.800",
      "end": "00:01:02.640",
      "text": "harder to find than the enemy Widow. If"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 61199,
      "end_ms": 63760,
      "start": "00:01:01.199",
      "end": "00:01:03.760",
      "text": "you want to figure out what any team is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 62640,
      "end_ms": 66080,
      "start": "00:01:02.640",
      "end": "00:01:06.080",
      "text": "thinking, just look at what they're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 63760,
      "end_ms": 67520,
      "start": "00:01:03.760",
      "end": "00:01:07.520",
