    },
    {
      "start_ms": 81520,
      "end_ms": 84240,
      "start": "00:01:21.520",
      "end": "00:01:24.240",
      "text": "is shoot what's in front of him and do a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 82960,
      "end_ms": 86560,
      "start": "00:01:22.960",
      "end": "00:01:26.560",
      "text": "lot of damage until he gets the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 84240,
      "end_ms": 88400,
      "start": "00:01:24.240",
      "end": "00:01:28.400",
      "text": "opportunity to duel Seeker. When he does"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 86560,
      "end_ms": 90000,
      "start": "00:01:26.560",
      "end": "00:01:30.000",
      "text": "get the opportunity, Seeker has no idea"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 88400,
      "end_ms": 93000,
      "start": "00:01:28.400",
      "end": "00:01:33.000",
      "text": "where he is and it's impossible to even"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 90000,
      "end_ms": 93000,
      "start": "00:01:30.000",
      "end": "00:01:33.000",
      "text": "react."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 102880,
      "end_ms": 106880,
      "start": "00:01:42.880",
      "end": "00:01:46.880",
      "text": ">> In the first fight, a lot of it is just"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 104560,
      "end_ms": 108479,
      "start": "00:01:44.560",
      "end": "00:01:48.479",
      "text": "who happens to find each other first. In"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 106880,
      "end_ms": 110880,
      "start": "00:01:46.880",
      "end": "00:01:50.880",
      "text": "every fight after though, it all comes"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 108479,
      "end_ms": 112079,
      "start": "00:01:48.479",
      "end": "00:01:52.079",
      "text": "down to skill. Every time you poke from"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 110880,
      "end_ms": 114560,
      "start": "00:01:50.880",
      "end": "00:01:54.560",
      "text": "somewhere, you should imagine yourself"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 112079,
      "end_ms": 116240,
      "start": "00:01:52.079",
      "end": "00:01:56.240",
