      "start_ms": 131760,
      "end_ms": 134480,
      "start": "00:02:11.760",
      "end": "00:02:14.480",
      "text": "waiting until he's low, and he's not"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 133120,
      "end_ms": 136400,
      "start": "00:02:13.120",
      "end": "00:02:16.400",
      "text": "waiting until people are close enough to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 134480,
      "end_ms": 137680,
      "start": "00:02:14.480",
      "end": "00:02:17.680",
      "text": "chase him. Now he's being pinged here"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 136400,
      "end_ms": 139040,
      "start": "00:02:16.400",
      "end": "00:02:19.040",
      "text": "and he's going to fire a couple shots,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 137680,
      "end_ms": 140319,
      "start": "00:02:17.680",
      "end": "00:02:20.319",
      "text": "but he's not going to wait too long and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 139040,
      "end_ms": 142400,
      "start": "00:02:19.040",
      "end": "00:02:22.400",
      "text": "he's not going to let people set up to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 140319,
      "end_ms": 143840,
      "start": "00:02:20.319",
      "end": "00:02:23.840",
