    {
      "start_ms": 159040,
      "end_ms": 163640,
      "start": "00:02:39.040",
      "end": "00:02:43.640",
      "text": "can just chase this and see if I can"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 160319,
      "end_ms": 163640,
      "start": "00:02:40.319",
      "end": "00:02:43.640",
      "text": "kill him again."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 178640,
      "end_ms": 181599,
      "start": "00:02:58.640",
      "end": "00:03:01.599",
      "text": "chances number two and three to get a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 180319,
      "end_ms": 182800,
      "start": "00:03:00.319",
      "end": "00:03:02.800",
      "text": "kill. We're somewhere in this midfight"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 181599,
      "end_ms": 184879,
      "start": "00:03:01.599",
      "end": "00:03:04.879",
      "text": "where everyone's just trying to shoot"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 182800,
      "end_ms": 186000,
      "start": "00:03:02.800",
      "end": "00:03:06.000",
      "text": "whatever's on their screen. However, now"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 184879,
      "end_ms": 187280,
      "start": "00:03:04.879",
      "end": "00:03:07.280",
      "text": "that he's being peened again and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 186000,
      "end_ms": 188959,
      "start": "00:03:06.000",
      "end": "00:03:08.959",
      "text": "everyone knows where he is, he's going"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 187280,
      "end_ms": 190480,
      "start": "00:03:07.280",
      "end": "00:03:10.480",
      "text": "to move one more time just to stop the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 188959,
      "end_ms": 192000,
      "start": "00:03:08.959",
      "end": "00:03:12.000",
      "text": "Tracer or the Freya from getting onto"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 190480,
      "end_ms": 195000,
      "start": "00:03:10.480",
      "end": "00:03:15.000",
      "text": "him."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 192000,
      "end_ms": 195000,
      "start": "00:03:12.000",
      "end": "00:03:15.000",
      "text": "Here"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 200319,
      "end_ms": 203519,
      "start": "00:03:20.319",
      "end": "00:03:23.519",
      "text": "we move to the left. Almost get the kill"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 201840,
      "end_ms": 204720,
      "start": "00:03:21.840",
      "end": "00:03:24.720",
      "text": "on CJ. And now one more time. We're"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 203519,
      "end_ms": 206080,
      "start": "00:03:23.519",
      "end": "00:03:26.080",
      "text": "going to be able to find Seeker in this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 204720,
      "end_ms": 209080,
      "start": "00:03:24.720",
      "end": "00:03:29.080",
      "text": "midfight where he doesn't know where I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 206080,
      "end_ms": 209080,
      "start": "00:03:26.080",
      "end": "00:03:29.080",
      "text": "am."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 213040,
      "end_ms": 215680,
      "start": "00:03:33.040",
      "end": "00:03:35.680",
      "text": ">> If you pay attention to a fight like"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 214239,
      "end_ms": 218319,
      "start": "00:03:34.239",
      "end": "00:03:38.319",
      "text": "this, Chronic has about four or five"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 215680,
      "end_ms": 220319,
      "start": "00:03:35.680",
      "end": "00:03:40.319",
      "text": "chances to get a kill. SSG, however,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 218319,
      "end_ms": 221760,
      "start": "00:03:38.319",
      "end": "00:03:41.760",
      "text": "specifically Seeker and Sugarfree barely"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 220319,
      "end_ms": 223120,
      "start": "00:03:40.319",
      "end": "00:03:43.120",
      "text": "know where he is most of the time. And"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 221760,
      "end_ms": 225360,
      "start": "00:03:41.760",
      "end": "00:03:45.360",
      "text": "even when they find him, he quickly"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 223120,
      "end_ms": 226640,
      "start": "00:03:43.120",
      "end": "00:03:46.640",
      "text": "moves to somewhere else. On this retake,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 225360,
      "end_ms": 230200,
      "start": "00:03:45.360",
      "end": "00:03:50.200",
      "text": "Chronic and Rocket are going to try and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 226640,
      "end_ms": 230200,
      "start": "00:03:46.640",
      "end": "00:03:50.200",
      "text": "find Seeker again."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 232159,
      "end_ms": 235599,
      "start": "00:03:52.159",
      "end": "00:03:55.599",
      "text": "Here they find him and start to force"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 233440,
      "end_ms": 237280,
      "start": "00:03:53.440",
      "end": "00:03:57.280",
      "text": "him out, but there's a big difference."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 235599,
      "end_ms": 239599,
      "start": "00:03:55.599",
      "end": "00:03:59.599",
      "text": "Seeker is playing this position until he"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 237280,
      "end_ms": 241280,
      "start": "00:03:57.280",
      "end": "00:04:01.280",
      "text": "gets forced out. Chronic plays positions"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 239599,
      "end_ms": 243680,
      "start": "00:03:59.599",
      "end": "00:04:03.680",
      "text": "like these and leaves before he gets"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 241280,
      "end_ms": 244959,
      "start": "00:04:01.280",
      "end": "00:04:04.959",
      "text": "forced out. Letting yourself get forced"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 243680,
      "end_ms": 246239,
      "start": "00:04:03.680",
      "end": "00:04:06.239",
      "text": "out of an angle like this means the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 244959,
      "end_ms": 247599,
      "start": "00:04:04.959",
      "end": "00:04:07.599",
      "text": "Tracer and the Freya are going to have a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 246239,
      "end_ms": 249439,
      "start": "00:04:06.239",
      "end": "00:04:09.439",
      "text": "lot more time to try and catch up to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 247599,
      "end_ms": 250879,
      "start": "00:04:07.599",
      "end": "00:04:10.879",
      "text": "you. Seeker might be able to get one"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 249439,
      "end_ms": 254599,
      "start": "00:04:09.439",
      "end": "00:04:14.599",
      "text": "corner away, but Chronic and Rocket are"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 250879,
      "end_ms": 254599,
      "start": "00:04:10.879",
      "end": "00:04:14.599",
      "text": "going to be very close behind."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 259359,
      "end_ms": 262320,
      "start": "00:04:19.359",
      "end": "00:04:22.320",
      "text": "Here, Seeker is definitely bitching"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 260959,
      "end_ms": 263759,
      "start": "00:04:20.959",
      "end": "00:04:23.759",
      "text": "about how Nightmare is just chasing him"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 262320,
      "end_ms": 265680,
      "start": "00:04:22.320",
      "end": "00:04:25.680",
      "text": "the whole game and asks if we could do"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 263759,
      "end_ms": 266800,
      "start": "00:04:23.759",
      "end": "00:04:26.800",
      "text": "the same thing to Chronic. However,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 265680,
      "end_ms": 268160,
      "start": "00:04:25.680",
      "end": "00:04:28.160",
      "text": "because of the difference we talked"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 266800,
      "end_ms": 270400,
      "start": "00:04:26.800",
      "end": "00:04:30.400",
      "text": "about last fight, it's not going to work"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 268160,
      "end_ms": 274360,
      "start": "00:04:28.160",
      "end": "00:04:34.360",
      "text": "on Chronic. Here, three or four people"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 270400,
      "end_ms": 274360,
      "start": "00:04:30.400",
      "end": "00:04:34.360",
      "text": "come to mark Chronic's ankle."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 276560,
      "end_ms": 280000,
      "start": "00:04:36.560",
      "end": "00:04:40.000",
      "text": "The difference is Chronic doesn't let"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 278080,
      "end_ms": 282400,
      "start": "00:04:38.080",
      "end": "00:04:42.400",
      "text": "himself get forced out of the angle. He"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 280000,
      "end_ms": 284080,
      "start": "00:04:40.000",
      "end": "00:04:44.080",
      "text": "leaves before he's forced to. This gives"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 282400,
      "end_ms": 288199,
      "start": "00:04:42.400",
      "end": "00:04:48.199",
      "text": "him way more time to escape and makes"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 284080,
      "end_ms": 288199,
      "start": "00:04:44.080",
      "end": "00:04:48.199",
      "text": "him way harder to keep track of."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 293680,
      "end_ms": 296880,
      "start": "00:04:53.680",
      "end": "00:04:56.880",
      "text": ">> His use of the Freya cool downs on the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 295199,
      "end_ms": 298320,
      "start": "00:04:55.199",
      "end": "00:04:58.320",
      "text": "rooftops are also a lot better to escape"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 296880,
      "end_ms": 300479,
      "start": "00:04:56.880",
      "end": "00:05:00.479",
      "text": "and makes him even harder to keep track"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 298320,
      "end_ms": 303040,
      "start": "00:04:58.320",
      "end": "00:05:03.040",
      "text": "of. While the duel is important, it's"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 300479,
      "end_ms": 304240,
      "start": "00:05:00.479",
      "end": "00:05:04.240",
      "text": "only one part of playing DPS. In my"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 303040,
      "end_ms": 305840,
      "start": "00:05:03.040",
      "end": "00:05:05.840",
      "text": "opinion, the thing that separates"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 304240,
      "end_ms": 307199,
      "start": "00:05:04.240",
      "end": "00:05:07.199",
      "text": "Chronic is his ability to make these"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 305840,
      "end_ms": 309360,
      "start": "00:05:05.840",
      "end": "00:05:09.360",
      "text": "plays, but also to play the game"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 307199,
      "end_ms": 310960,
      "start": "00:05:07.199",
      "end": "00:05:10.960",
      "text": "normally when it demands it. What I mean"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 309360,
      "end_ms": 312479,
      "start": "00:05:09.360",
      "end": "00:05:12.479",
      "text": "by play the game normally is just do"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 310960,
      "end_ms": 314800,
      "start": "00:05:10.960",
      "end": "00:05:14.800",
      "text": "high amounts of damage, shoot other"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 312479,
      "end_ms": 316160,
      "start": "00:05:12.479",
      "end": "00:05:16.160",
      "text": "people, force tank cool downs, all the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 314800,
      "end_ms": 318160,
      "start": "00:05:14.800",
      "end": "00:05:18.160",
      "text": "kinds of things your team expects you to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 316160,
      "end_ms": 319520,
      "start": "00:05:16.160",
      "end": "00:05:19.520",
      "text": "do as the person with the most damage."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 318160,
      "end_ms": 320800,
      "start": "00:05:18.160",
      "end": "00:05:20.800",
      "text": "If you need a video on how to play hit"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 319520,
      "end_ms": 322320,
      "start": "00:05:19.520",
      "end": "00:05:22.320",
      "text": "scan normally, I made one of those a"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 320800,
      "end_ms": 324000,
      "start": "00:05:20.800",
      "end": "00:05:24.000",
      "text": "while ago. Here, we're going to see"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 322320,
      "end_ms": 325600,
      "start": "00:05:22.320",
      "end": "00:05:25.600",
      "text": "Chronic look for the duel again. But as"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 324000,
      "end_ms": 326800,
      "start": "00:05:24.000",
      "end": "00:05:26.800",
      "text": "soon as he realizes that Seeker's too"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 325600,
      "end_ms": 328000,
      "start": "00:05:25.600",
      "end": "00:05:28.000",
      "text": "safe, he's just going to play the game"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 326800,
      "end_ms": 331000,
      "start": "00:05:26.800",
      "end": "00:05:31.000",
      "text": "normally and everyone's going to kill"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 328000,
      "end_ms": 331000,
      "start": "00:05:28.000",
      "end": "00:05:31.000",
      "text": "Kellen."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 336240,
      "end_ms": 339600,
      "start": "00:05:36.240",
      "end": "00:05:39.600",
      "text": "There is the dual opportunity, but if"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 337840,
      "end_ms": 341199,
      "start": "00:05:37.840",
      "end": "00:05:41.199",
      "text": "the enemy is playing too safe, don't let"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 339600,
      "end_ms": 343440,
      "start": "00:05:39.600",
      "end": "00:05:43.440",
      "text": "them bait you into taking a duel you"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 341199,
      "end_ms": 344720,
      "start": "00:05:41.199",
      "end": "00:05:44.720",
      "text": "can't win. Don't ever forget to shoot"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 343440,
      "end_ms": 348280,
      "start": "00:05:43.440",
      "end": "00:05:48.280",
      "text": "the rest of the people on your screen"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 344720,
      "end_ms": 348280,
      "start": "00:05:44.720",
      "end": "00:05:48.280",
      "text": "and play the game normally."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 356080,
      "end_ms": 360080,
      "start": "00:05:56.080",
      "end": "00:06:00.080",
      "text": "If you get good at this, you can"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 357360,
      "end_ms": 361440,
      "start": "00:05:57.360",
      "end": "00:06:01.440",
      "text": "effectively do two jobs at once. Here I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 360080,
      "end_ms": 362560,
      "start": "00:06:00.080",
      "end": "00:06:02.560",
      "text": "am dueling the Freya and I'm stopping"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 361440,
      "end_ms": 365120,
      "start": "00:06:01.440",
      "end": "00:06:05.120",
      "text": "him from doing a lot of damage by"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 362560,
      "end_ms": 366639,
      "start": "00:06:02.560",
      "end": "00:06:06.639",
      "text": "forcing him off his angle, but I'm also"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 365120,
      "end_ms": 368479,
      "start": "00:06:05.120",
      "end": "00:06:08.479",
      "text": "firing shots at the backline and at"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 366639,
      "end_ms": 369840,
      "start": "00:06:06.639",
      "end": "00:06:09.840",
      "text": "Kellum. If you're on the other end of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 368479,
      "end_ms": 371440,
      "start": "00:06:08.479",
      "end": "00:06:11.440",
      "text": "this, it's important to make sure that"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 369840,
      "end_ms": 372800,
      "start": "00:06:09.840",
      "end": "00:06:12.800",
      "text": "if you're hiding from a duel, you still"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 371440,
      "end_ms": 374800,
      "start": "00:06:11.440",
      "end": "00:06:14.800",
      "text": "go into a position where you can do"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 372800,
      "end_ms": 376160,
      "start": "00:06:12.800",
      "end": "00:06:16.160",
      "text": "something else. If you find yourself"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 374800,
      "end_ms": 377680,
      "start": "00:06:14.800",
      "end": "00:06:17.680",
      "text": "hiding in a position where you can't"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 376160,
      "end_ms": 379600,
      "start": "00:06:16.160",
      "end": "00:06:19.600",
      "text": "shoot anybody, your position is probably"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 377680,
      "end_ms": 381199,
      "start": "00:06:17.680",
      "end": "00:06:21.199",
      "text": "pretty [ __ ] On Hollywood and on"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 379600,
      "end_ms": 382800,
      "start": "00:06:19.600",
      "end": "00:06:22.800",
      "text": "Sojourn, it's a lot more clear how he"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 381199,
      "end_ms": 385280,
      "start": "00:06:21.199",
      "end": "00:06:25.280",
      "text": "balances playing normally with trying to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 382800,
      "end_ms": 386639,
      "start": "00:06:22.800",
      "end": "00:06:26.639",
      "text": "make plays. Here, they're retaking. And"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 385280,
      "end_ms": 388160,
      "start": "00:06:25.280",
      "end": "00:06:28.160",
      "text": "if I wanted to make a play, I'd slide"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 386639,
      "end_ms": 390800,
      "start": "00:06:26.639",
      "end": "00:06:30.800",
      "text": "onto the top left high ground and start"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 388160,
      "end_ms": 392240,
      "start": "00:06:28.160",
      "end": "00:06:32.240",
      "text": "shooting high. But to start this fight,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 390800,
      "end_ms": 393440,
      "start": "00:06:30.800",
      "end": "00:06:33.440",
      "text": "there's no reason I can't just shoot the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 392240,
      "end_ms": 394880,
      "start": "00:06:32.240",
      "end": "00:06:34.880",
      "text": "people in front of me, do a lot of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 393440,
      "end_ms": 397880,
      "start": "00:06:33.440",
      "end": "00:06:37.880",
      "text": "damage, and try and force some tank cool"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 394880,
      "end_ms": 397880,
      "start": "00:06:34.880",
      "end": "00:06:37.880",
      "text": "downs."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 401120,
      "end_ms": 404080,
      "start": "00:06:41.120",
      "end": "00:06:44.080",
      "text": "Here you'll see he just finds a safe"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 402560,
      "end_ms": 405039,
      "start": "00:06:42.560",
      "end": "00:06:45.039",
      "text": "angle where Seeker can't shoot him, and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 404080,
      "end_ms": 408039,
      "start": "00:06:44.080",
      "end": "00:06:48.039",
      "text": "he just shoots the [ __ ] out of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 405039,
      "end_ms": 408039,
      "start": "00:06:45.039",
      "end": "00:06:48.039",
      "text": ">> Ken."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 412479,
      "end_ms": 416479,
      "start": "00:06:52.479",
      "end": "00:06:56.479",
      "text": "It's only when they hear and see people"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 414560,
      "end_ms": 417759,
      "start": "00:06:54.560",
      "end": "00:06:57.759",
      "text": "on SSG step out of line that he decides"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 416479,
      "end_ms": 420319,
      "start": "00:06:56.479",
      "end": "00:07:00.319",
      "text": "it's time to slide top and make this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 417759,
      "end_ms": 420319,
      "start": "00:06:57.759",
      "end": "00:07:00.319",
      "text": "play."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 423919,
      "end_ms": 427120,
      "start": "00:07:03.919",
      "end": "00:07:07.120",
      "text": "Now, there's a lot of things that can be"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 425520,
      "end_ms": 429280,
      "start": "00:07:05.520",
      "end": "00:07:09.280",
      "text": "triggers to make a play. You don't have"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 427120,
      "end_ms": 431199,
      "start": "00:07:07.120",
      "end": "00:07:11.199",
      "text": "to wait for people to step out of line,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 429280,
      "end_ms": 432639,
      "start": "00:07:09.280",
      "end": "00:07:12.639",
      "text": "but it is really important as a hit scan"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 431199,
      "end_ms": 434080,
      "start": "00:07:11.199",
      "end": "00:07:14.080",
      "text": "to make sure you're not giving up the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 432639,
      "end_ms": 436319,
      "start": "00:07:12.639",
      "end": "00:07:16.319",
      "text": "normal advantages you get from your"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 434080,
      "end_ms": 437840,
      "start": "00:07:14.080",
      "end": "00:07:17.840",
      "text": "role. There's no reason to slide top and"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 436319,
      "end_ms": 439599,
      "start": "00:07:16.319",
      "end": "00:07:19.599",
      "text": "make a play when you could play the game"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 437840,
      "end_ms": 441840,
      "start": "00:07:17.840",
      "end": "00:07:21.840",
      "text": "normally first, get value out of that,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 439599,
      "end_ms": 443199,
      "start": "00:07:19.599",
      "end": "00:07:23.199",
      "text": "and then slide top and make a play."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 441840,
      "end_ms": 446759,
      "start": "00:07:21.840",
      "end": "00:07:26.759",
      "text": "Here, Nightmare is just trying to defend"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 443199,
      "end_ms": 446759,
      "start": "00:07:23.199",
      "end": "00:07:26.759",
      "text": "the high ground retake."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 457759,
      "end_ms": 460400,
      "start": "00:07:37.759",
      "end": "00:07:40.400",
      "text": "All we did at first was shoot through"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 459039,
      "end_ms": 461680,
      "start": "00:07:39.039",
      "end": "00:07:41.680",
      "text": "the window, see if anybody was going to"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 460400,
      "end_ms": 465080,
      "start": "00:07:40.400",
      "end": "00:07:45.080",
      "text": "try to come back top. And now I'm just"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 461680,
      "end_ms": 465080,
      "start": "00:07:41.680",
      "end": "00:07:45.080",
      "text": "going to shoot Kell."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 467199,
      "end_ms": 470319,
      "start": "00:07:47.199",
      "end": "00:07:50.319",
      "text": ">> It's only when I see Secret out of line"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 469199,
      "end_ms": 471520,
      "start": "00:07:49.199",
      "end": "00:07:51.520",
      "text": "here that I'm going to stop shooting"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 470319,
      "end_ms": 474759,
      "start": "00:07:50.319",
      "end": "00:07:54.759",
      "text": "Kellen. I'm going to see if I can get"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 471520,
      "end_ms": 474759,
      "start": "00:07:51.520",
      "end": "00:07:54.759",
      "text": "this kill."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 480000,
      "end_ms": 483440,
      "start": "00:08:00.000",
      "end": "00:08:03.440",
      "text": "After he gets his normal hit scan value,"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 482000,
      "end_ms": 485919,
      "start": "00:08:02.000",
      "end": "00:08:05.919",
      "text": "he realizes there's a big play to be"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 483440,
      "end_ms": 487759,
      "start": "00:08:03.440",
      "end": "00:08:07.759",
      "text": "made here. Since nobody knows where I"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 485919,
      "end_ms": 492199,
      "start": "00:08:05.919",
      "end": "00:08:12.199",
      "text": "am, I can use my overclock to flank"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 487759,
      "end_ms": 492199,
      "start": "00:08:07.759",
      "end": "00:08:12.199",
      "text": "right and maybe get a kill."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 495280,
      "end_ms": 498280,
      "start": "00:08:15.280",
      "end": "00:08:18.280",
      "text": ">> One"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 498800,
      "end_ms": 504440,
      "start": "00:08:18.800",
      "end": "00:08:24.440",
      "text": "here. He's pixels away from getting"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 500639,
      "end_ms": 504440,
      "start": "00:08:20.639",
      "end": "00:08:24.440",
      "text": "Bliss kicked off of SSG."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 505759,
      "end_ms": 508800,
      "start": "00:08:25.759",
      "end": "00:08:28.800",
      "text": "And there's one more for good measure."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 507680,
      "end_ms": 510319,
      "start": "00:08:27.680",
      "end": "00:08:30.319",
      "text": "Here again, we're going to see him"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 508800,
      "end_ms": 511680,
      "start": "00:08:28.800",
      "end": "00:08:31.680",
      "text": "balance the duel and zon in the enemy"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 510319,
      "end_ms": 515560,
      "start": "00:08:30.319",
      "end": "00:08:35.560",
      "text": "hit scan with just trying to get other"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 511680,
      "end_ms": 515560,
      "start": "00:08:31.680",
      "end": "00:08:35.560",
      "text": "forms of value on the map."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 517919,
      "end_ms": 520800,
      "start": "00:08:37.919",
      "end": "00:08:40.800",
      "text": "First, we shoot Kell's walk up. Then, we"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 519599,
      "end_ms": 524760,
      "start": "00:08:39.599",
      "end": "00:08:44.760",
      "text": "shoot Seeker to try and make it"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 520800,
      "end_ms": 524760,
      "start": "00:08:40.800",
      "end": "00:08:44.760",
      "text": "difficult for him to peek us."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 535920,
      "end_ms": 542040,
      "start": "00:08:55.920",
      "end": "00:09:02.040",
      "text": "Now that Kell's been forced down, I can"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 537600,
      "end_ms": 542040,
      "start": "00:08:57.600",
      "end": "00:09:02.040",
      "text": "go back to dueling and make my big play."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 544640,
      "end_ms": 547920,
      "start": "00:09:04.640",
      "end": "00:09:07.920",
      "text": ">> Effectively shutting down Seeker this"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 546240,
      "end_ms": 550080,
      "start": "00:09:06.240",
      "end": "00:09:10.080",
      "text": "whole fight and shooting Kellen at the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 547920,
      "end_ms": 551360,
      "start": "00:09:07.920",
      "end": "00:09:11.360",
      "text": "same time. If it doesn't look that hard"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 550080,
      "end_ms": 554240,
      "start": "00:09:10.080",
      "end": "00:09:14.240",
      "text": "to you, it's because you're not watching"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 551360,
      "end_ms": 556000,
      "start": "00:09:11.360",
      "end": "00:09:16.000",
      "text": "POVs very closely. If you're a hit scan"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 554240,
      "end_ms": 557519,
      "start": "00:09:14.240",
      "end": "00:09:17.519",
      "text": "or just a DPS that wants to make a lot"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 556000,
      "end_ms": 559760,
      "start": "00:09:16.000",
      "end": "00:09:19.760",
      "text": "more plays and carry like Chronic is"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 557519,
      "end_ms": 562560,
      "start": "00:09:17.519",
      "end": "00:09:22.560",
      "text": "doing here, pay attention to the way he"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 559760,
      "end_ms": 564080,
      "start": "00:09:19.760",
      "end": "00:09:24.080",
      "text": "moves around the map and when. Chronic"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 562560,
      "end_ms": 565440,
      "start": "00:09:22.560",
      "end": "00:09:25.440",
      "text": "is very hard to keep track of and it"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 564080,
      "end_ms": 568160,
      "start": "00:09:24.080",
      "end": "00:09:28.160",
      "text": "makes not dying to him almost"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 565440,
      "end_ms": 570240,
      "start": "00:09:25.440",
      "end": "00:09:30.240",
      "text": "impossible. On top of that, he doesn't"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 568160,
      "end_ms": 572080,
      "start": "00:09:28.160",
      "end": "00:09:32.080",
      "text": "force his playmaking."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 570240,
      "end_ms": 574000,
      "start": "00:09:30.240",
      "end": "00:09:34.000",
      "text": "He does tons of damage and gets tons of"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 572080,
      "end_ms": 577200,
      "start": "00:09:32.080",
      "end": "00:09:37.200",
      "text": "normal value in neutrals before he tries"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 574000,
      "end_ms": 577200,
      "start": "00:09:34.000",
      "end": "00:09:37.200",
      "text": "to make these kinds of plays."
    }
  ]
}
